[
  {
    "text": "日常生活的织锦",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.10071910091700689,
      "left": 0.3627450829248366,
      "width": 0.27450980620914983,
      "height": 0.030303029040404043
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "每个星期六早上6点30",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.16446939418877496,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.19215683326797478,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "分,第一批顾客还没到,",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.1871966659690781,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21568627630718912,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "河湾市场的摊主们就已经",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2099239377493811,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.2156862763071892,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "开始卸货了。这个市场自",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2326512095296841,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21568627630718912,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "1948年起就开在杨树街的",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2553784813099871,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.2196273985694463,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "四个街区上,据老街坊",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.27810575309029006,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.1960784330065356,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "说,七十多年来从未停过",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3008330248705931,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21568627630718912,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "一个星期。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3235602966508962,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.09803921650326781,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "如今这里大约有140个摊",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.35859817397886334,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.20786269746650488,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "位,而十年前只有85个。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3813254457591663,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21960781364379167,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "根据市政府2023年的调",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4040527175394693,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.20392151821895602,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "查,市场在普通周末能吸",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4267799893197724,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21568627630718912,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "引约12000名顾客,每年",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4495072611000754,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21178424730310702,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "为本地经济带来约420万",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4722345328803785,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21176466446078568,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "元的收入(周边的咖啡馆",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.49496180466068146,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21568627630718912,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "和小店还不算在内)",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5176890764409845,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.17647058970588206,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5176890764409845,
      "left": 0.28921567863562075,
      "width": 0.014705878308823618,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "“大家都以为我们卖的是蔬",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5536739234264643,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.22621568175081685,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "菜,",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5764011952067674,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.03921568660130712,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "”在这里摆了27年菜摊",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5764011952067674,
      "left": 0.15196077896241825,
      "width": 0.1849803681503274,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "的王秀兰说,“其实我们卖",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5991284669870703,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.226215675623366,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "的是一个让人愿意进城的",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6218557387673733,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21568627630718912,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "理由。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6445830105476764,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.058823529901960686,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "”她说,卖得最好",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6445830105476764,
      "left": 0.17156862177287577,
      "width": 0.14288234649754902,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "的",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6445830105476764,
      "left": 0.31445096827042485,
      "width": 0.01960784330065354,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "还是两块钱一袋的什锦青",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6673102823279796,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21568627630718912,
      "height": 0.015151514520201985
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "菜。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6900375541082826,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.03921568660130712,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "数据也印证了她",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7250754314362496,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.1372549031045749,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "的说法。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7250754314362496,
      "left": 0.2549019570261436,
      "width": 0.07843137320261416,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "赶集日的人流量比其他星",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7478027032165527,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21568627630718912,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "期六高出38%,四分之三",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7705299749968558,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.2190195678349686,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "的顾客表示,他们还顺便",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7932572467771588,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21568627630718912,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "去了附近的其他店铺。省",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8159845185574618,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21568627630718912,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "立大学的经济学家李明教",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8387117903377648,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.2156862763071892,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "授把这种现象称",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.16446939418877496,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.13725490310457492,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "为“溢出效",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.16446939418877496,
      "left": 0.5228821909583393,
      "width": 0.08896078505506512,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "应”。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.1871966659690781,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.049745090819444705,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "当然,问题也不少。今年1",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2222345432970452,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.22354902147075129,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "月,摊位费从每天35元涨",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2449618150773482,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.2196078136437917,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "到了50元,几位老摊主说",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2676890868576512,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21960781952614447,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "这笔开销很难承受。停车",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.29041635863795434,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21568627630718906,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "依然是最常见的抱怨:最",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3131436304182573,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21568627630718906,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "近的公共停车场只有220",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3358709021985603,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.2117646753431381,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "个车位,通常上午9点15分",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.35859817397886334,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.2274705390514722,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "之前就停满了。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3813254457591663,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.13725490310457492,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "市议会正在考虑一项提",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4173102927446461,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.19607843300653552,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "案,计划在5月1日至10月",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4400375645249492,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21572542311928336,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "31日期间再封闭两个街",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.46276483630525217,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.19609801033415117,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "区,禁止车辆通行。支持",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.48549210808555515,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21568627630718906,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "者认为这样可以多容纳40",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5082193798658583,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21960782232026194,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "个摊位;反对者则担心送",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5309466516461613,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21568627630718906,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "货不便,也担心老年居民",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5536739234264643,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21568627630718906,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "出行困难。不少年轻人习",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5764011952067674,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21568627630718906,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "惯用手机App付款,摊主",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5991284669870703,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21233330071160236,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "们也陆续贴出了二维码。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6218557387673733,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21568627630718906,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "眼下,一切照旧。到了中",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6568936160953404,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21568627630718906,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "午,面包已经卖光,花桶",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6796208878756437,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21568627630718906,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "空了一半,喷泉旁边有一",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7023481596559467,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21568627630718906,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "支铜管乐队在演奏(五位",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7250754314362496,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21568627630718906,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "退休教师,自称“第二",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7478027032165527,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.1869999880416669,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "春”)",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7705299749968558,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.049745090819444705,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "。下午2点,卡车又重",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7705299749968558,
      "left": 0.43047041760294763,
      "width": 0.18333332005718958,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "新装满了。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7932572467771588,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.09803921650326783,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "关于封路计划的公开听证",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.828295124105126,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21568627630718906,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "会定于3月14日星期四晚上",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.851022395885429,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.22747054395343277,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "O",
